  "details": "1. Create a Group Plus instance and join it.\n\n2. Using another account, open the World Detail menu with the instance\n\n3. Then, the \"Drop Portal\" button is enabled. Use it to try to place a portal.\n\n4. The portal appears, then it disappears instantly.\n\nIf the instance type is Friend Plus, the \"Drop Portal\" button is disabled. I expected it is also disabled in the Group Plus case.\n\nLog:\n\n```\n\n2023.05.31 23:23:54 Log        -  [Always] Fetched local user permissions\n\n2023.05.31 23:24:00 Error      -  The local user is not a member of this group\n\n2023.05.31 23:24:03 Log        -  [Always] [PortalManager] Received portal request failure!\n\n```",
